/// @namespace wxLife
/// Root namespace of wxLife: the simulation, its rendering and the wxWidgets UI (see docs/architecture.md).

/// @namespace wxLife::core
/// The simulation (world model, rules, stepping engines, limits and pacing), using only the standard library.

/// @namespace wxLife::core::kernel
/// The stepping hot loop, kept apart so it can be compiled with its own optimisation flags.

/// @namespace wxLife::render
/// Pixel types, camera and rasterizer that turn a Grid into canvas pixels; uses core, never wx.

/// @namespace wxLife::ui
/// The wxWidgets user interface: main frame, canvas, side panel, dialog, theme colours and simulation timer.

/// @namespace wxLife::ui::defaults
/// Start-up settings of the application.

/// @namespace wxLife::app
/// The wxApp entry point, which owns the World.
